{"logId": "c92ff53a-2180-4df7-be93-623b2d177356", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——理财", "block_bbox": [363, 120, 789, 166], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[363.0, 120.0], [789.0, 120.0], [789.0, 166.0], [363.0, 166.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "标准等级：", "block_bbox": [400, 231, 544, 267], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[400.0, 231.0], [544.0, 231.0], [544.0, 267.0], [400.0, 267.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "一级【0~1分】：不因物质、金钱等给自己或他人造成沉重的经济压力、精神包袱，甚至痛苦和伤害。（底线原则）", "block_bbox": [398, 307, 1612, 390], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[398.0, 307.0], [1612.0, 307.0], [1612.0, 390.0], [398.0, 390.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "二级【1~2分】：侧重于追求更多的金钱和物质，缺少了对现有生活的体验和享受。（生存阶段）", "block_bbox": [398, 406, 1559, 442], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[398.0, 406.0], [1559.0, 406.0], [1559.0, 442.0], [398.0, 442.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "三级【2~3分】：不让欲望大于能力，能够合理地支配收入，有正确、理性的金钱观，知足常乐。（由生存走向生活）", "block_bbox": [398, 456, 1615, 540], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[398.0, 456.0], [1615.0, 456.0], [1615.0, 540.0], [398.0, 540.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "四级【3~4分】：能够轻松驾驭金钱，金钱和物质的多少不影响生活的幸福度，更在意精神价值的创造。（生活阶段）", "block_bbox": [398, 555, 1611, 639], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[398.0, 555.0], [1611.0, 555.0], [1611.0, 639.0], [398.0, 639.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "五级【4~5分】：面对一切得失都坦然从容，即便一无所有也保持满足圆润的生命状态。", "block_bbox": [399, 654, 1450, 690], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[399.0, 654.0], [1450.0, 654.0], [1450.0, 690.0], [399.0, 690.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[75]", "block_bbox": [967, 970, 1020, 996], "block_id": 7, "block_order": null, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[967.0, 970.0], [1019.0, 970.0], [1019.0, 995.0], [967.0, 995.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.868131697177887, "coordinate": [363, 120, 789, 166], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[363.0, 120.0], [789.0, 120.0], [789.0, 166.0], [363.0, 166.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7713911533355713, "coordinate": [400, 231, 544, 267], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[400.0, 231.0], [544.0, 231.0], [544.0, 267.0], [400.0, 267.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9131180047988892, "coordinate": [398, 307, 1612, 390], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[398.0, 307.0], [1612.0, 307.0], [1612.0, 390.0], [398.0, 390.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8582603335380554, "coordinate": [398, 406, 1559, 442], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[398.0, 406.0], [1559.0, 406.0], [1559.0, 442.0], [398.0, 442.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.911038875579834, "coordinate": [398, 456, 1615, 540], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[398.0, 456.0], [1615.0, 456.0], [1615.0, 540.0], [398.0, 540.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9134846329689026, "coordinate": [398, 555, 1611, 639], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[398.0, 555.0], [1611.0, 555.0], [1611.0, 639.0], [398.0, 639.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8488123416900635, "coordinate": [399, 654, 1450, 690], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[399.0, 654.0], [1450.0, 654.0], [1450.0, 690.0], [399.0, 690.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.6438885927200317, "coordinate": [967, 970, 1020, 996], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[967.0, 970.0], [1019.0, 970.0], [1019.0, 995.0], [967.0, 995.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——理财\n\n## 标准等级：\n\n一级【0~1分】：不因物质、金钱等给自己或他人造成沉重的经济压力、精神包袱，甚至痛苦和伤害。（底线原则）\n\n二级【1~2分】：侧重于追求更多的金钱和物质，缺少了对现有生活的体验和享受。（生存阶段）\n\n三级【2~3分】：不让欲望大于能力，能够合理地支配收入，有正确、理性的金钱观，知足常乐。（由生存走向生活）\n\n四级【3~4分】：能够轻松驾驭金钱，金钱和物质的多少不影响生活的幸福度，更在意精神价值的创造。（生活阶段）\n\n五级【4~5分】：面对一切得失都坦然从容，即便一无所有也保持满足圆润的生命状态。", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//c92ff53a-2180-4df7-be93-623b2d177356/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A39%3A38Z%2F-1%2F%2F32508f46825d08f0a06bb40cacb7294b15788aa6e6340f713abdd0fea55132aa"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//c92ff53a-2180-4df7-be93-623b2d177356/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A39%3A38Z%2F-1%2F%2F1727486c47b1d94de67e407e60439cf3f9f9c2af0069944e64533a75cc0cb7b5"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1920, "height": 1080}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//c92ff53a-2180-4df7-be93-623b2d177356/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A39%3A38Z%2F-1%2F%2F59327a07ce524b4e670fcc5496f998d425f55504e69d10fc0c5178a125e8ef8f"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
